  "attribution": "來源：《焦氏易林》，易學網《焦氏易林［四庫全書版］》（依據版本：《欽定四庫全書》子部術數類），https://www.eee-learning.com/book/giauii 。依來源要求標示出處及原網頁連結；本站僅整理林辭原文，並記錄收錄、標點及文字整理修改。",
  "entryCount": 64,
  "missingTargets": [],
  "entries": [
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 39,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 39,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 39,
      "hexagramName": "蹇",
      "poemText": "同濟共輿，中道別去。喪我元夫，獨與孤苦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8ca03199815159f1a9bfb7409560562112f9047bd11d76add22ae03a9ceba1d9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7f7a8fefec65d40ee71f85929f7c27f5b1d475c26807299676a9861745162675"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 1,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 1,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 1,
      "hexagramName": "乾",
      "poemText": "叔肸居冤，祁子自邑。乘遽解患，羊舌免脫。賴得生全。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8f791fae6b226afaeda236f02ad17f37a91f669aecf7f278838ddec444719c10",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8b9ccb737e05a177558435d8ef68cb94f7f721f524c3a4f644a0ff02860753df"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 2,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 2,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 2,
      "hexagramName": "坤",
      "poemText": "兔聚東郭，眾犬俱獵。圍缺不成，無所能獲。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c151a4f9ccad7f9d33551e0c5cbd7e2fd4d0d931996c076fd6991ab1ce87a174",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:86613a9fa7d69b893792c6172dfe3d078f9d114c31c96bee0bbff7a89222eed0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 3,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 3,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 3,
      "hexagramName": "屯",
      "poemText": "作室山根，人以為安。一夕崩顛，敗我壺餐。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6da7604b7f9fd333bf0d802ce537b0af178448c7afd5a44a2a5ac90644e81867",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f05895039d47363539bf3f9510505fa3f2f502704145b1b305391d7e78aa34e3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 4,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 4,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 4,
      "hexagramName": "蒙",
      "poemText": "疾風塵起，亂我崩始。彊大并小，先否後喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a32301fe2d48848a5971de6c852426505121c5f26113ec6e7241719dc3229a14",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:052ab7b796f88c47c2fda6d39105f72445645677f3845ec4647e90d5497220cd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 5,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 5,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 5,
      "hexagramName": "需",
      "poemText": "潔齋沐浴，思明居德。哀公怯弱，風氏復北。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:247ae8e347b8ef0ee3df6c9ee6edc5e8158e0501bca41bd10f6f3b91e09a5130",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7424a73dfdb2e66b9d1ac4ed24c54b6862426df0e42166999007ebb955961e26"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 6,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 6,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 6,
      "hexagramName": "訟",
      "poemText": "土瘠瘦薄，培塿無柏，使我不樂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3f3eb70c1937873f50d4087790c4f6aa63a68d746c79e29528a56d485b2b96d6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:67149e708aa15782a9c98a56e4c80bab92d07d4d27e32022128f150bf688afeb"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 7,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 7,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 7,
      "hexagramName": "師",
      "poemText": "褰衣涉河，澗流波多。賴遇舟子，濟脫無他。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d1787d57867d7aab35252f7ccc1740871203e06297ad1a3605d8fb694e666a48",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0fbd0c42bb3ca8b9f06ced42994cd204d1b3cb48aa91aed9d2f1a36f3771c394"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 8,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 8,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 8,
      "hexagramName": "比",
      "poemText": "送我季女，瑩于蕩道。齊子旦夕，留連久處。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7fa5273c0c5b1aa439c20b4e9e2c5b0579cd395beb4cfa8b9fece1c3d95f0ebc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7a7364040bd644275c64b77ac5feb62308322ea2fc9589f4db8e107f9a63f601"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 9,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 9,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 9,
      "hexagramName": "小畜",
      "poemText": "三孫六子，安無所苦。中藏廢殆，亡我所使。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2b149e406d9db58c166df049645da9cb28aa131ba300be56c6333196a4ce9a9d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:15806b92c0a0ea36f568a5a6b19e82f76df70d09342b6faec3c9e5c54312670e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 10,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 10,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 10,
      "hexagramName": "履",
      "poemText": "揚風偃草，塵埃俱起。清濁溷散，忠直隱處。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c46fd816915dceeea64ed9f177992ae0b910c40710b8d1c69c708c9396ce139b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4fd412cdf19a3db424677209801451721925ab502a1391350e8de205d8603ec9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 11,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 11,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 11,
      "hexagramName": "泰",
      "poemText": "歷險登危，道遠勞疲。去家自歸，困涉大波。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:103954787434ac4e32b7a4669302ad9f54697bd6932951789a4fc6cc1733ee1f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a4e73f425dc5a70a0d88bc5028628e1f4ab8e9156a4a57aee49a90e2f86a873a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 12,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 12,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 12,
      "hexagramName": "否",
      "poemText": "六藝之門，仁義俱存。鎡基逢時，堯舜為君。傷寒執溫，下至黃泉。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d54fbb91680596cfc23a174949f35165ff28fe617f3ece6115641e8bbce83571",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:af704c0f075a3c2ed83c1aa54fd33330c9cbe3b5785e8ef2bc126ac0bb868f9e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 13,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 13,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 13,
      "hexagramName": "同人",
      "poemText": "被服文衣，遊觀酒池。上堂見觴，喜為吾兄。使我憂亡。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:317514c1a9af8771b3643ee2f6b34bafb2660d0efb6baf8dbaec6cf670bb2b90",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d9b4be23cdb06f40b61b2b43767b07dd89cd12e21e6c4103eb8587ed75c434ae"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 14,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 14,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 14,
      "hexagramName": "大有",
      "poemText": "生時不利，天命災至。制於斧瘢，當夜勤苦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2e547d82164b5712bbbfc65dcf00fbf8b7c3a78bf3fccc69dce8d5ab5c70765d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e7608cca519fc65e406971ffb7a7a3087ba29a81596c0e1f97e3cf4d6cb9c927"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 15,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 15,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 15,
      "hexagramName": "謙",
      "poemText": "天門開闢，牢戶寥廓。桎梏解脫，拘囚縱釋。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e63257a6ef1c66d5e3d173ed23fbf8f95e30989ea8baa61350643f6897362cb7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ba8d67db2e15b6b8912d0f00e36ef9414ea95ed14786813db0008a32bfaa408a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 16,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 16,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 16,
      "hexagramName": "豫",
      "poemText": "川淵難遊，水為我憂。多言少實，命鹿為駒。道德開基，君子逢時，利以中疑。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e40a53b058824d17928fbe333bd2b427497b8d8f61a1ffd09892f7c0b6dfb92f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a46e0ef8f6e0e622f3e0cb25142267c4e962b66447b4c9980024e979506af3ec"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 17,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 17,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 17,
      "hexagramName": "隨",
      "poemText": "鄉歲逢時，與生為期。枝葉盛茂，君子無憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c34858e755412e4c9a6e5cd9382527047e40dbe7b41aae124a41e0601ce099b1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f94339282601ce02773af83772765c72149bffc13e5397065fe1931be20b4741"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 18,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 18,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 18,
      "hexagramName": "蠱",
      "poemText": "六鷁退飛，為衰毀祥。陳師合戰，左股夷傷。遂崩不起，霸功不成。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a36efd9c76312efa77b48fb32101e5e28550eb8895cd5617fd3ae3bb26ab6953",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:cd0ddd6d5623888571e21187c1123d02ad1b274e93a0821b15697803e3b6fda5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 19,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 19,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 19,
      "hexagramName": "臨",
      "poemText": "雷君出裝，隱隱西行。霖雨不止，流為河江。南國憂凶。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d7d19fe68669d2fda6f4192b051abb45dc781be427b29257c0b8cbf0d81dfa80",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7c1c58f113bcf0dafe6c3d269e7d0d957aa37eaf78efa5ba92e21f0b9cc0a366"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 20,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 20,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 20,
      "hexagramName": "觀",
      "poemText": "牙孽生齒，陽倡於外。左手執籥，公言錫爵。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:228df86d228a42e896f3a638c1a8650884057de5b63904dcede47411fc6fe0ad",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1dcc830eb5113ae83584a83f83285225db515dfc4acc24c94c9e290a4b407db0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 21,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 21,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 21,
      "hexagramName": "噬嗑",
      "poemText": "火起土門，不為我殘。跳脫東西，獨得生完。不利出鄰，病疾憂患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:06b1c25b824deca81eb9cc1ddd0ad26ba141d0b1825f3102aaf3ac31a8db1863",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5efa752f0dffd15d65e85d00cdb969fc03281a2f0d070fd38a540580138a8bed"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 22,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 22,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 22,
      "hexagramName": "賁",
      "poemText": "舉事無成，不利出征。言不可用，眾不能平。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e58dd0ce36bf150aa8697db4d37b668d224b487d7f4ddc382d471aef6c5c8d05",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d2ae97e44574864a2c7cc2234e811b2a1c4a4bc79cfbf6d87ef7c95014164516"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 23,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 23,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 23,
      "hexagramName": "剝",
      "poemText": "老狼白驢，長尾大胡。前顛卻躓，進退遇祟。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:42b701c8e8869a769bc60995a5820ac84a6ed0c45327a020b9566666b06ad269",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e5fa6e48923505da78a62604f4577be224a2f8c05e9b87a4b6d0995b58f44745"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 24,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 24,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 24,
      "hexagramName": "復",
      "poemText": "日入道極，勞者休息。班馬還師，復我燕室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:49c009515baf8936ec2a986817c61270d766bf90bdc514a845ec377a09daa7a7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:df687108b1f0df1a9381a6d313956f8fbfd98d676cf1592b79f1b1d1ba02bcd2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 25,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 25,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 25,
      "hexagramName": "无妄",
      "poemText": "山林麓藪，非人所處。鳥獸無禮，使我心苦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cc0dbca2468fe67ccf62500f3238fe28758ab2a294819ef488b7aa014ff6802b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b61710330da234b0bab9acdc7c0d90a5422aaaf18e604eb87f6061108e2482c2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 26,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 26,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 26,
      "hexagramName": "大畜",
      "poemText": "蓄利積福，日新其德。高氏飲食，憂不為患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a7b235aa59fdeeef4f6e22f43fb5dd50d471ac7c0259e7ad6813fb527dd79344",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b6dd51d719631826bc8e3c59dc83883b410c910d4cab5da20c10249d22dc07f8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 27,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 27,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 27,
      "hexagramName": "頤",
      "poemText": "張羅百目，鳥不得北。縮頸掛翼，困於窘國。君子治德，獲譽受福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:241a962664c67be41c40f7e36ec3ca0482093b35b63bd2a890dbcd457d718f3a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2d387040a86988664da0dc840884d1778e607955840a4f6f1a810c2d9ee21686"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 28,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 28,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 28,
      "hexagramName": "大過",
      "poemText": "伯虎仲熊，德義淵弘。使布五教，陰陽順序。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e2b9bedd7fa62424b742b7489277e4381d9ff4afb6c3e85c9ecd35289df2b493",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8caaf3b5a29103a14edd23e508077d27d46aa5a5bd5556163f2b432a7cf1f1a9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 29,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 29,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 29,
      "hexagramName": "坎",
      "poemText": "跛踦相隨，日暮牛罷。陵遲後旅，失利亡雌。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:18cfffa73d65161db933b3c3fcb6a7a14b1314b6b7dd5d4182038cc8b70cb367",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:095b7fb7675a591a34da18a59e826c06bfd2ebeeda96b63a9251140d9dd18bda"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 30,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 30,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 30,
      "hexagramName": "離",
      "poemText": "嬴氏違良，使孟尋兵。老師不已，敗於齊卿。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:66e3229f36a1b8d35ee8ac3184c061e238512f36160bf7f19bec6eadf6a8be52",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2cc150881ebb28f349b9b0ee8105ebffc69a179ef85c06536981472b2a3e3f08"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 31,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 31,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 31,
      "hexagramName": "咸",
      "poemText": "日月並居，常暗且微。高山崩顛，丘陵為溪。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:72823407982ea34420b9e7526b9b4cdb6321756c476ad280e9c07bf8458f991c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b0b8b286f3b3a99994353e064c33bf1fa9d8cabb3ce3c8dbea45ff1b2f5d57d2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 32,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 32,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 32,
      "hexagramName": "恒",
      "poemText": "烏鵲食穀，張口受哺。蒙恩被德，長大成就。柔順利貞，君臣相好。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a01d311628747aead268948d9d1f7058174de819baf72e8ccbb1d6b321e7f154",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a83544d09490f92e20f73fde41ad35bf78546a9b7866c03a10c537953316d526"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 33,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 33,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 33,
      "hexagramName": "遯",
      "poemText": "雖躓復起，不毀牙齒。克免平復，憂除無疾。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d4765fb2193e51f9a0e7b603535a09e4b03264e0ff7b8d450ae53279551c45b9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f7a615cdbc198a4704ab18bd7aa150201cec4f13efb1b9d63a21b632d0a50720"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 34,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 34,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 34,
      "hexagramName": "大壯",
      "poemText": "草木黃落，歲暮無室。虐政為賊，大人失福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6d848e924c56e5d0b5ac8a6405250b585e02f76f45bd11e9b3f982a32556f641",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c1cf576b22df14d1054680604084fa2aa3e68241c964d9e2c08fb69bcd748cc7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 35,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 35,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 35,
      "hexagramName": "晉",
      "poemText": "避凶東走，反以禍口。制於牙爪，骨為灰土。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7f3d00b148378979e18d24220b079de270c500ff7ed37944569fd42547f670a3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:558d34761e98e99d5c5a3285a8d47fee3b355edb33a2ce4d45e127ae9d4372e6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 36,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 36,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 36,
      "hexagramName": "明夷",
      "poemText": "欲飛不能，志苦心勞，福不我來。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ebb0d35b35348f5166c1e9f68daecd936fa0ec662b8258b925ceec236f95e82d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:73ee839ccfc498ebbcec568725d09ef518a6b0a59003cfa50d8c9a834f1c3dd2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 37,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 37,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 37,
      "hexagramName": "家人",
      "poemText": "羔裘豹褎，東與福遇。駕迎吾兄，送我驪黃。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ee8a01b4a3a17c9399ec8a21a86243e4ec84e4d20ac08a76106a3c70a32eccbf",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:cc611efe2f77b02617e32edbb7298386f0c598d63f4945c4898108cbd72270fd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 38,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 38,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 38,
      "hexagramName": "睽",
      "poemText": "東耕破犁，西失良妻。災害不避，家貧無資。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e6fb6e7119be0c48e406fdd80ebaca5cf8e2712c4ea9019d11eb190a5b6c314b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3c94b5bb6cb6228be7c4341706881ea1942fa312330d05a4b9ab64362f0c6680"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 40,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 40,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 40,
      "hexagramName": "解",
      "poemText": "魚陸失所，鳥蠅困苦。澤無萑蒲，晉國以墟。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2a55edd7df0f2fc95be014db37944db3c0349689e66602ac28a7dd71ef467c36",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5af0d097048483dd2399b83202d6fb49b3de45444e18dd74e52d60085239e813"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 41,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 41,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 41,
      "hexagramName": "損",
      "poemText": "脫兔無蹄，三步五罷。南行不進，後市勞苦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:05684e815835a4ef316bac1c2dc94442725eba1feb9294923423c31147eb259c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:93c404aad0480ae02a37d7eeb1b9cf24d538f95d051ad225753164f923b80156"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 42,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 42,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 42,
      "hexagramName": "益",
      "poemText": "行役未已，新事復起。姬姜勞苦，不得休止。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cf5c271b1141f3e8c6680d114f5ffab65a6e8e2f0f384e4bc6a4486a78db421a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:94baa145998ad3fa9f9797db2720b4f5aaf9704fbfc304c79054a2943f436cf4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 43,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 43,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 43,
      "hexagramName": "夬",
      "poemText": "向日揚光，火為正王。消金厭兵，雷車避藏。陰雨不行，民定其鄉。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:eb4c2c44d0205bc4b0d94c1af19627c900f432be47579ecdca06b2f324b533f2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1b65ea993f2c88c9f5378f1bfcf415e8610af2591f37d47e2ba87da4341563e4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 44,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 44,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 44,
      "hexagramName": "姤",
      "poemText": "放銜垂轡，奔馬不制。棄法作奸，君失其位。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:698b25b6758591dac3f3f57c22044e410b2f4367e41c6d1fd4d302416090ddaa",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fd5c285bd25dd19bb3b15537b4832e912da366fdc8daba2006be3aa8effbd89e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 45,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 45,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 45,
      "hexagramName": "萃",
      "poemText": "司命不游，喜解我憂。皇母緩帶，嬰兒笑喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:099f1c3d0347a465555d60601971042cb866c5836bf66aa40ebd4e5c777eb775",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fefa9422cd54ea9ea15ceeb80f3740c5c5eab431033d293d1ffa2c795599a073"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 46,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 46,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 46,
      "hexagramName": "升",
      "poemText": "黃帝出游，駕龍乘馬。東上泰山，南過齊魯。郡國咸喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4eee6b6584dc2731f4ae4499f059c7aac4a533788119b8b2bb2caf65dd4db981",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f10fd40e53082b26af0e17fa7d71c41ff7163906d5ddf2911b1b684c1e80770d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 47,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 47,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 47,
      "hexagramName": "困",
      "poemText": "既往不說，憂來禍結。比戶為患，無所申冤。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c003e9b0c61d460aa1845b8c2deefbc78ffbfb1e46096df8f6e6ffd3ad59573f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4ab80ebb39521fef6da1fc97a92510fec9f7bf567d784d709e5ab526dfa5be95"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 48,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 48,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 48,
      "hexagramName": "井",
      "poemText": "荷蕢隱居，以避亂傾。終身不仕，遂其潔清。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2c686ba1cd3c4bf643344fe2440fa066217cfad2ab9cfc3d4af2cddf2843fa40",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f57239a66f1a08aa627e00d02d7ddf470e922f98f7ec00a2fa409d856602f0a4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 49,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 49,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 49,
      "hexagramName": "革",
      "poemText": "折梃舂稷，君不得食。頭痒搔跟，無益於疾。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:658491eb2392b9aa8fa2239aa581166aadc47fdb0f37f123589f58ebb572a828",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b3b2fe83eef7aed7ee11be3e87f5ba8dad15619b6779fa958e02c5fc0a4ee310"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 50,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 50,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 50,
      "hexagramName": "鼎",
      "poemText": "植根不固，華葉落去，便為枯樹。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:044cd0cf685d657d2802af47e242e55613d6308824e9ba488778be75e7a24236",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:cebf33e0fb86ec426aeae4afb004db9926e630d1bb7eeb163e5a20788067831c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 51,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 51,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 51,
      "hexagramName": "震",
      "poemText": "凶門生意，牢戶多冤。沙陁禿齒，使我困窮。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7c187edf61ca62ebdf3d310e0e817fb30987b8652e817e235fb6dd088c241eea",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:770af211c8b30da9937efe1da4b9fbaee433e841d7de8ff5bc035753443c353c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 52,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 52,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 52,
      "hexagramName": "艮",
      "poemText": "登山履谷，與虎相觸。猬為功曹，班奴奔北。脫之喜國。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b0166c01e8508ad831b64edb0545869828feada455d2d0387f7aae47a84b4e5a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:16f4eae1601d6db22aac1b2d743f60f08f352135078ca4404d6639497c4800a7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 53,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 53,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 53,
      "hexagramName": "漸",
      "poemText": "麟鳳所翔，國無咎殃。賈市十倍，復歸惠里。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:23d9c761ec0954f4d2985f0fb9e235a728926c4ddc7b288242122bcc9aa2131c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ace96e44430742184ea7c2bcc216ae6d4aad5038d97c7fd1b59b7c443fe0d443"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 54,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 54,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 54,
      "hexagramName": "歸妹",
      "poemText": "路險道難，水過我前。進往不利，回車復還。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:97fd926c4df85d661efd9750fa266b18589dfcfb21b98066b6d24e92a757c2dd",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c754b404ab11142abc4be9928ae5042addbb8d9b603836557455bec5088412ce"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 55,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 55,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 55,
      "hexagramName": "豐",
      "poemText": "延頸望邑，思歸我室。臺榭不成，未得安息。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:df74eaa60ee9b735bdcb4a353524aaf5f053ed9e028a98383ad33fcdee3d1965",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6d5a8edd044802fbedfdb7489935c0ef06bb25cb037fcc7993e820d2ad511751"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 56,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 56,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 56,
      "hexagramName": "旅",
      "poemText": "蒙生株瞿，棘掛我鬚。小人嫉妒，使恩不遂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6db781a924812c65cee13d262d2271c232ca4fdb203cbe755031546531b35463",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fa6f8503de5b340077cf3c15af06e9ed83eef69b6f502edd9d339ad6dc6ce3f7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 57,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 57,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 57,
      "hexagramName": "巽",
      "poemText": "南至隱域，深潛處匿。聰明閉塞，與死為伍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8f96aab994252b22de8c051fd8ba039cb990b28fec0450a462c2ca9293b57479",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f58e71b396db13a7028bdef913bab2e99aa80bdc3126a6bcb39aa0a3a06a334e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 58,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 58,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 58,
      "hexagramName": "兌",
      "poemText": "機餌設張，計暴子良。范叔不廉，凶害及身。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cfa72b42b4a6dc1dc9c82591eb008a551127d6deee07952f6b23676877c18340",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:91d29824084261a17c4bcae6ad6f3a0fb6ed00253f7bc61947bd6fcda64c0488"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 59,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 59,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 59,
      "hexagramName": "渙",
      "poemText": "從騎出谷，遊戲苦域。坡高不進，利無所得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4782427695d2a209f69b8a95bb65ac6dfda503841c852ebf6f4bae010b5e1778",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f9afa76729c6ee22c6dc132e3a4c8f82169b437c357781c5ec4156843b52ba45"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 60,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 60,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 60,
      "hexagramName": "節",
      "poemText": "西國彊梁，為虎作狼。東吞齊楚，并有其王。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f94f874fd3e27ba242033cadaa7597dd7c6ed1fd02a99c615846eaaf56e854d9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b9b92344339054e21b58c54c6b8fd8770885eb6600ea2f1b198e6eb714866e9a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 61,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 61,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 61,
      "hexagramName": "中孚",
      "poemText": "登山伐輻，虎在我側。王孫無懼，仁不見賊。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3c1e258015904d29ab71f65d13f8b425ad8dba7ac5ff2d82e7c73ed813df40d0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ce6ac06804aa58fe170272722f3b6dc7be4c6de0be245f8ca4954ceb84030afb"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 62,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 62,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 62,
      "hexagramName": "小過",
      "poemText": "六目睽睽，各欲有至。後來未壯，候待明旦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:576851e3f6efa5e0aaf3fb9c2f7e9725c1c6b4dead17724ca9126129ff998087",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:67e457dc79aeb9a11baf55a9802ce5d59a71f679e32506ebcac8a81ac35ff5ee"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 63,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 63,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 63,
      "hexagramName": "既濟",
      "poemText": "道涉多阪，牛馬蛇蟺。車不利載，請求不得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ee17a573845195aca9b9cc5838b9286865a3876984dbfc128b0eaef4c1748330",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:44f5b7be8f65ace969c295f3c06e083a306c5ace3693d29c53318964603690be"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 39,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 64,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 64,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 64,
      "hexagramName": "未濟",
      "poemText": "一口三舌，相妨無益。群羊百牂，不為威彊。亡馬失駒，家耗於時。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:50a0996bbbd453ca2107957527ccce631b21f564aaa71c417494c1ff706299f3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2e279b1e3100dbbb56ec133553ea50c0f2fd3641a85035874fda1c15f0f6f9d5"
    }
  ]
}
